cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
authors:
  - name: RakTikoo
title: "icslint: lint an iCalendar (.ics) file against RFC 5545 and documented importer failures"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-18
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/RakTikoo/icslint"
repository-code: "https://github.com/RakTikoo/icslint"
abstract: >-
  Lints iCalendar (.ics) files against the requirements RFC 5545 actually
  states and the import failures Google, Outlook and Apple Calendar are
  documented to have. Every rule cites the RFC or a named, dated importer
  source; it says nothing about anything that cannot be proven from the file
  alone.
keywords:
  - iCalendar
  - RFC 5545
  - lint
  - calendar
  - validation
